Recommends: libstereo-policy1
Description: stereo pictures for GIMP 3: MPO, JPS, PNS and both-eyes editing
 Opens MPO (CIPA DC-007), JPS and PNS stereo photographs as "Left eye" and
 "Right eye" layers, exports the same formats with each format's own stereo
 mark, and adds a Stereo menu: split, join and swap the eyes, align them
 vertically, and edit a side-by-side picture one eye at a time or with both
 eyes alike at a chosen depth. The edition's GIMP shows such images in 3D.
 .
 Part of Sparky Stereo OS, an edition of SparkyLinux.
